{
  "description": [
    "Çapadan pozisyon tahmininin doğruluk kümesi (PLAN §3.2).",
    "",
    "Neden var: pozisyon webview'de çekirdeğe sormadan tahmin ediliyor, yani",
    "formülün ikinci bir kopyası JS'te yaşıyor. İki kopya zamanla kayar ve kayma",
    "kimsenin fark etmediği bir yerde başlar — ilerleme çubuğu birkaç yüz",
    "milisaniye yalan söyler, kimse şikâyet etmez, sonra Faz 4'te aynı formül",
    "oda senkronunu sürer.",
    "",
    "Bu dosya iki tarafın da okuduğu tek doğruluk kaynağı. Rust tarafı:",
    "crates/tune-core/tests/anchor_parity.rs. JS tarafı:",
    "crates/tune/tests/anchor_parity.mjs (crates/tune/ui/anchor.js üzerinden).",
    "",
    "Anahtarlar ve vaka adları İngilizce (D-036): bu dosya iki dilden okunuyor",
    "ve kümeyi büyütecek kişi Türkçe bilmek zorunda değil.",
    "",
    "wall_time ve now RFC 3339. expected_ms tam sayı milisaniye."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "time advances while playing",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 10000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:05Z",
      "expected_ms": 15000
    },
    {
      "name": "paused does not advance",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 10000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "paused",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:05Z",
      "expected_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "name": "buffering does not advance — no audio yet, so the counter must not run",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 10000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "buffering",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:05Z",
      "expected_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "name": "stopped keeps the position where it is",
      "anchor": {
        "track": null,
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 0,
        "rate": 0.0,
        "state": "stopped",
        "duration_ms": null
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:05Z",
      "expected_ms": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "rate 0 does not advance even when the state says playing",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 10000,
        "rate": 0.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:05Z",
      "expected_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "name": "phase 4 drift correction: rate 1.001 — TRUNCATED, not rounded",
      "note": [
        "100000 * 1.001 ikilik tabanda tam 100100 etmez, 100099.999… eder.",
        "Çekirdek `as u64` ile kırpıyor: 100099. JS tarafı Math.round kullanırsa",
        "100100 der ve iki kopya buradan ayrılır — kümedeki en değerli vaka bu.",
        "JS karşılığı: Math.floor(elapsed_ms * rate)."
      ],
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 0,
        "rate": 1.001,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:01:40Z",
      "expected_ms": 100099
    },
    {
      "name": "a backwards clock jump does not rewind the position",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:10Z",
        "position_ms": 10000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
      "expected_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "name": "does not exceed the duration",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 118000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 120000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:30Z",
      "expected_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "name": "no clamping when the duration is unknown",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 118000,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": null
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:30Z",
      "expected_ms": 148000
    },
    {
      "name": "same instant: nothing has advanced",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 7321,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
      "expected_ms": 7321
    },
    {
      "name": "sub-second: 1.5 s at rate 1.0",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00.000Z",
        "position_ms": 0,
        "rate": 1.0,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:01.500Z",
      "expected_ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "name": "half speed",
      "anchor": {
        "track": "mbid:1",
        "wall_time": "2026-08-31T12:00:00Z",
        "position_ms": 0,
        "rate": 0.5,
        "state": "playing",
        "duration_ms": 240000
      },
      "now": "2026-08-31T12:00:10Z",
      "expected_ms": 5000
    }
  ]
}
